No formal license text is distributed with the font. The fonts' embedded
license URL points to https://mincult.gov.ua, and the Ministry of Culture
of Ukraine's Zakon page (https://mincult.gov.ua/zakon/) states:

  "Zakon Text ... відкрита для вільного використання необмеженого кола осіб"
  (Zakon Text is open for free use by an unlimited circle of persons.)

The companion faces Zakon Decor and Zakon Letterpress are under a closed
license and are NOT included in this package.

This package does not redistribute the font files; they are downloaded
from the Ministry's official Google Drive at build time.
